I.O[1879450859] = { { "Musgovilla", "Mossward", "El pequeño pueblo fronterizo de Musgovilla se encuentra no muy lejos de los puentes rotos de la anegada Tharbad, pero si entre su gente quedan descendientes del orgulloso pueblo que comerciaba antaño...", "The small border village of Mossward is located not far from the broken bridges of flooded Tharbad, but if any of its folk are descended from the proud people who conducted trade along the Greyflood,..." }, { "Clegur", "Clegur", "Hogar de una recia rama de hobbits que antaño fue abundante en la región, el pueblo de Clegur es un lugar de paz y tranquilidad. Bajo la atenta mirada del Alcalde Malmadog Torlan, los Fuertes que...", "Home to a rustic strain of hobbit that was once plentiful in the area, the village of Clegur is a place of peace and quiet. Under the watchful eye of Mayor Malmadog Torlan, the Stoors who live here..." }, { "Lhan Garan", "Lhan Garan", "Lhan Garan es un asentamiento de construcción relativamente reciente, fundado al borde de los pantanos del Aguaestancada por dunlendinos que viajaron al norte en busca de una vida mejor que aquella...", "Lhan Garan is a settlement of fairly recent construction, established on the edge of the marshes of the Wadewater by Dunlendings who have come north in search of a better life than the one they..." }, { "Glyn Helyg", "Glyn Helyg", "El pueblo de Glyn Helyg es único entre los asentamientos del Valle de los Fuertes porque está construido a lo largo del acantilado de un estrecho barranco con vistas a una estruendosa cascada. Ojalá...", "The village of Glyn Helyg is unique among the other settlements of the Stoor-vales in that it is constructed along the cliffside of a narrow gully in view of a roaring waterfall. It is to be hoped..." }, { "Lintrev", "Lintrev", "Lintrev es hogar de muchos de los granjeros que proveen a la gente de los valles del pan y los pasteles que constituyen la base de la dieta de los Fuertes. El huerto de manzanos que domina las...", "Lintrev is home to many of the farmers who provide the folk of the vales with the breads and cakes that are staples of the Stoors' diet. The apple orchard that overlooks the village outskirts is a..." }, { "Echad Terthas", "Echad Terthas", "Desde su campamento en Echad Terthas, el Montaraz Duindil vigila los peligros que acechan al Eregion Occidental y a las ruinas cercanas de Caras Gelebren. La antigua ciudadela del herrero élfico...", "From his camp-site of Echad Terthas, the Ranger Duindil keeps a watchful eye upon the dangers that encroach upon Western Eregion and the nearby ruins of Caras Gelebren. The old citadel of the..." }, { "Idhobel", "Idhobel", "Desde el campamento élfico de Idhobel, unos pocos vigilan los peligros que han surgido recientemente en el Eregion Occidental. Los uruks que perturban la Ciénaga de los Cisnes parecen especialmente...", "From the Elf-camp of Idhobel, a few folk keep watch on the dangers that have arisen in recent days in Western Eregion. The Uruks that trouble Swanfleet seem particularly interested in the ruins of..." } }
